  <item>
    <title>Vol 006：坦白局！在参与多轮裁员沟通后我发现了这些真相</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/653e4c9e21aad9875421bfa1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">653e4c9e21aad9875421bfa1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 29 Oct 2023 12:14:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期话题【裁员谈判发现的那些真相】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期大家将听到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">01:27</a> 持续半年的裁员氛围</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="213">03:33</a> 职场新人都会有的职业理想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="254">04:14</a> 裁员前有哪些蛛丝马迹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="347">05:47</a> 打工人的命运很难被自己掌控</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="427">07:07</a> 决定是否上裁员名单的因素有哪些</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="738">12:18</a> 一个夹心饼干的无奈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="788">13:08</a> 不要轻易相信橄榄枝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1151">19:11</a> 岗位属性和薪资一样重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 当老板不再追问你的业务时</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1484">24:44</a> 不要在算钱的时候谈感情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1872">31:12</a> 我们还需要在工作中寻找意义么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2317">38:37</a> 用找对象的方式找工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2360">39:20</a> 所有寄期待于内卷的老板最后都会被卷走</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2546">42:26</a> 选领导就是选“老公”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2611">43:31</a> 如何计算好自己在职场中的价码</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2827">47:07</a>.如何管理好自己资产负债</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3078">51:18</a> 平稳的心态面对裁员与未来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3524">58:44</a> 有时候习惯内卷也是一种舒适区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3645">1:00:45</a> 自由的鸟儿不会害怕离开监狱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3753">1:02:33</a> 挖掘机的推荐~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhcChA0x5buVu8lm-8NYZmL_NET2.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>主播：丸子</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：金币挖掘机</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：水晶小笼包</span></p><span></span><p><span>即刻/小红书/微博：丸子小姐很认真</span></p>]]></description>
