    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播丸子</span></p><span></span><p><span>即刻：丸子小姐很认真</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期话题【学习人设-质疑人设-放弃人设】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期大家将听到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a> 我为啥会学习打造人设</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="116">01:56</a> 让你年入百万的课长这样儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="286">04:46</a> 我尝试入门，结果人设的门向我关闭了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="397">06:37</a> 当博主既要自律又要卷还要懂的传播定律</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="484">08:04</a> 传播学的两条核心要素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="544">09:04</a> 涨粉最快的三类博主都有哪些特质</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1213">20:13</a> 普通人真的适合做自媒体人设打造么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1508">25:08</a> 做内容需要哪些前期准备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1551">25:51</a> 如何找到自己擅长的方向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1551">25:51</a> 如何找到自己擅长的方向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1763">29:23</a> 小特征也许代表了一群人的诉求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1957">32:37</a> 与同频的人聊天可以更好的丰满自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2295">38:15</a> 副业真正赚钱的人都是怎么赚到的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2961">49:21</a> 放弃人设打造收获不焦虑的创作心态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3025">50:25</a> 追求结果的是欲望 享受过程的是理想</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>无问-毛不易</span></p>]]></description>
